# Branching & Workflow Policy for AI Agents

Whenever you start a new conversation or task in this repository:
1. You MUST check out a separate feature or bugfix branch (e.g., `feature/<task-name>` or `conversation/<conversation-id>`).
2. Do NOT make edits or commits directly to the `main` or `master` branches.
3. The `main` or `master` branches should only be modified when ready for a Pull Request (PR).
4. If you are currently on `main` or `master`, immediately checkout a new branch before modifying any codebase files.
